      "Mom Wasn’t Happy",
      "",
      "Daxing didn’t hear what his parents said. Daxing and I were on TikTok.",
      "",
      "Mom said, “Daxing!”",
      "",
      "Daxing looked at his mom and said, “What’s the matter?”",
      "",
      "Mom said, “Did you hear what we said?”",
      "",
      "“What did you say?” Daxing didn’t know. ",
      "",
      "“How was school today?” Mom asked. ",
      "",
      "“Very good,” said Daxing.",
      "",
      "“How about your studies?” Dad asked. ",
      "",
      "“Very good,” said Daxing.",
      "",
      "“Did you read your books?” Mom asked.",
      "",
      "“Very good,” said Daxing.",
      "",
      "“Daxing!” Mom was a little unhappy and said, “Stop looking at your phone and eat!",
      "And don’t play with your phone at school.",
      "You’re a student. You’re in the third year of senior high school. You must study!”"
